# Expense Manager Web

Standalone Next.js 16 repository. Consumes the **separate** `ExpenseManager.API` backend.

## Backend Integration

- API calls go through `src/lib/axios.ts` (baseURL `/api/v1`)
- Dev proxy: `next.config.ts` rewrites to `API_PROXY_TARGET` in `.env.local`
- Backend runs independently — coordinate API contract via backend `API_DOC.md`
- Singular routes: `/expense`, `/category`, `/auth`, `/reports`, `/export`

## Before Making Changes

1. Read `AGENTS.md` in this repo
2. Keep `src/types/index.ts` aligned with backend DTOs
3. Never commit `.env.local` or hardcode backend URLs in components
4. Work only in this repo — do not assume backend code is available
